In addition, there's been a few changes of name: the Wizard of Balance
to Neferet the Green (in 3.4.0), ronin to roshi (in 3.2.0), that sort
of thing.

> - Dungeon: Sokoban added to the game.

In 3.3.0, which version also noticeably reduced the length of
