glass. 3.4.0 introduced leather cloaks and touchstones.

> - Dungeon features: Graves.

3.3.0 introduced trees, iron bars, and graves.

> - Dungeon rooms: Leprechaun halls, Antholes, Cockatrice nests, Swamp
> levels, probably one or two others I'm forgetting.

3.1 had swamp levels; they've been in the game since Hack 1.0.2. The
